---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Creative coding experiments
permalink: "/experiments/"
description: Notes and sketches from generative art and p5.js explorations.
---

<section class="hero">
  <h1 class="hero__title">Creative coding experiments</h1>
  <p class="hero__subtitle">I use p5.js and other playful tools to explore motion, texture, and storytelling through code.</p>
</section>

<div class="grid grid--two">
  {% for experiment in collections.experiments %}
    <article class="card">
      {% if experiment.data.image %}
        <div class="card__media"><img src="{{ experiment.data.image }}" alt="{{ experiment.data.title }}"></div>
      {% endif %}
      <h2 class="card__title"><a href="{{ experiment.url }}">{{ experiment.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ experiment.data.summary }}</p>
      <div class="card__actions"><a href="{{ experiment.url }}">Read the story →</a></div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
